{
  "id": 204569521,
  "iid": 9762,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "CoAP: properly dissect OCF version options",
  "description": "As another follow-up to https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/9692, this MR introduces a custom CoAP dissector function for the OCF version options. The option values should now be displayed as semantic versions (e.g., `1.3.2`), as illustrated by the screenshot below. This corresponds with the OCF core specification, where the options are defined.\n\n![grafik](/uploads/e5d5963b8891e9373a90b6fda7856386/grafik.png)\n\nI assume adding this function should also make it easier to disable vendor-specific options as suggested by @stigbjorlykke in https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/9692#note_1269006490.",
  "state": "merged",
